flowchart TD
 A[3 years approved daily history IF available] --> B[Data quality / point-in-time feature join]
 B --> C[Chronological train / validation / sealed test]
 C --> D[Naive / Seasonal baseline]
 C --> E[Random Forest & XGBoost]
 D --> F[Compare MAE RMSE WAPE by regime]
 E --> F
 F --> G{Champion-Challenger gate}
 G -->|pass and human approved| H[Register and deploy signed model]
 G -->|fail| I[Keep current champion]
 H --> J[Predict and store immutable run]
 J --> K[Actual later approved]
 K --> L[Monitor error & drift]
 L --> M[Monthly candidate retraining]
 M --> C
